Scanner payload / detection ideas — OWASP & sqlmap (conceptual, no code copied)
The Scanner module (app/src/main/java/com/victorious/browser/scanner/) uses
small, well-known probe strings and DBMS error-fingerprint patterns that are
common public knowledge, as documented in:
  - OWASP Web Security Testing Guide (XSS / SQLi / SSRF test categories)
    https://owasp.org/www-project-web-security-testing-guide/
    License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 (CC BY-SA 4.0)
  - sqlmap SQL error-message fingerprints (DBMS error signatures, as popularized
    by the project) https://github.com/sqlmapproject/sqlmap
    License: GNU GPL v2
No source files or data files from these projects are copied into this
repository; the signatures were re-expressed independently and this notice
credits the conceptual origin and their licenses.
The OOB collaborator client is interactsh-compatible by configuration only; no
interactsh (ProjectDiscovery, MIT) code is bundled or vendored.

